{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]I tore down the walls [C6]I built my[Bb]self
[Dm]The law said I [C6]was dead and [Bb]still
[Dm]I died to the [C]rules that bind my [Bb]soul
So I could [Gm7]live for God [C]with no con[Dm]trol
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
I have been [Bb]cruci[C]fied with [Dm]Christ
